{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261125/photo/bkn-20261125095029045-1125_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261125163219\"/><p>赤柱正灘泳灘。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日(25日)宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；以及西貢區的銀線灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該處游泳會有危險，市民勿在該處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:04:06.868917+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T01:50:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T13:17:20.594999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T08:57:19.846437+00:00","content_hash":"10175626e88585ce661780f7fb0ee4cb03233eacf761a69b3f5a92f384c26643","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-25T09:04:06.868917+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}